<Base title="Privacy" description="How OKtoPress handles your uploads and waitlist email.">
<div class="wrap narrow"><h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>Plain and short:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Uploads:</strong> art you upload to the checker is used only to make your report, and is deleted after 24 hours.</li>
<li><strong>Waitlist:</strong> if you join the waitlist, we store the email and any optional details you type (shop name, website, country, platform) so we can contact you about launch. Ask us and we'll delete it.</li>
<li><strong>Counts, not people:</strong> we count checks and embed loads per shop. We don't store IP addresses, user agents or tracking cookies.</li>
<li>We don't sell your data.</li>
</ul>
<p class="muted">OKtoPress is made in Nelson, BC, Canada.</p></div>
</Base>
